{"type": "say", "text": "Thanks, Mara. I appreciate the opportunity to be part of this roundtable. I'm open to the idea of a combined forum — the declining attendance is a real concern, and bringing both groups together could help re-energize participation around our shared initiatives. But I do want to flag that there have been some dynamics between Northstar and Mosaic participants in our recent forums that I think we need to address before any combined session can work well. I have some specific observations I'd like to put on the record today, along with a recommendation for how we can make sure everyone's voice is heard in a combined setting. I'd like to formally share those now if this is the right time for it."}
```

