{"type": "say", "text": "Thanks, Mara. I'm glad to be here as HR Business Partner for this roundtable. Before we get too far into the specifics of scheduling and operating rules, I need to flag something important from a policy compliance standpoint that affects how we structure this combined forum. There are specific policy requirements that apply to any ERG merger or combined forum pilot, and I need to make sure we address those before any approval is given. I'd like to lay those out now so everyone is working from the same understanding as we continue the discussion. Devin, Leila — I'm happy to hear your observations and scheduling needs, but I want to make sure we get the policy framework on the table first so we don't design something that can't be approved."}
