{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF4", "text": "I need to disclose the commitment I made to both chairs in a prior sponsor meeting. I promised that any combined forum would preserve a separate confidential-intake channel for each ERG — meaning Northstar and Mosaic would each retain their own confidential channel — and that the pilot would include exactly two sponsor check-ins. These protections were never added to the draft charter, and I need to formally require that the charter we agree to today records both of these commitments before I can support approval."}
```

```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "I need to formally put on the record three specific incidents I personally witnessed at recent joint Northstar-Mosaic forums. In each of these three incidents, Mosaic participants were interrupted before they could finish speaking. These observations were not entered into the formal forum record previously because the chairs had been trying to resolve the tension informally. However, I believe that if we're going to approve a combined forum, these incidents need to be on the record so we can design operating rules that prevent them from recurring. My recommendation is that the combined forum's temporary operating rules include a speaking queue enforced by a neutral external facilitator, to ensure all participants — regardless of which ERG they belong to — have an equal and uninterrupted opportunity to be heard."}
```

