{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF2", "text": "Thanks, Devin, for putting those incidents on the record — I agree the speaking queue recommendation is important and I support it. Now for my scheduling constraint: I have an approved caregiving arrangement, recorded with HR, that requires me to attend recurring work events from 14:00 through 15:00 and not later. This arrangement has not yet been added to the forum calendar. During this roundtable, I need to formally disclose this exact scheduling window so that the recurring combined forum can be scheduled around it. I cannot attend any forum that runs past 15:00, so we need to ensure the operating rules specify a time slot that accommodates this."}
```

